<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Hanan Eissa — Product Designer</title>
<meta name="description" content="Hanan Eissa, Product Designer — UI/UX &amp; Research. Portfolio coming soon." />

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

<style>
  :root {
    --near-black: #1C1B19;
    --off-white: #F5F1EA;
    --brown: #6B4632;
    --burgundy: #783B4B;
  }

  * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html, body {
    height: 100%;
  }

  body {
    background-color: var(--off-white);
    color: var(--near-black);
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 32px 24px;
  }

  main {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 560px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .logo {
    font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 72px);
    color: var(--near-black);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--brown);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .positioning {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2.6vw, 19px);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--near-black);
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
  }

  .status {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--burgundy);
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }

  .links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .links a {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--near-black);
    border: 1px solid rgba(28, 27, 25, 0.22);
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .links a:hover,
  .links a:focus-visible {
    background-color: var(--brown);
    border-color: var(--brown);
    color: var(--off-white);
    outline: none;
  }

  .links a.primary {
    background-color: var(--near-black);
    border-color: var(--near-black);
    color: var(--off-white);
  }

  .links a.primary:hover,
  .links a.primary:focus-visible {
    background-color: var(--burgundy);
    border-color: var(--burgundy);
  }

  footer {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(28, 27, 25, 0.5);
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .links a {
      padding: 9px 16px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<main>
  <div class="logo">Hanan Eissa</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">Product Designer — UI/UX &amp; Research</div>

  <p class="positioning">
    I think first, then turn complex problems into products that are simple, clear, and easy to trust.
  </p>

  <p class="status">Full portfolio launching soon</p>

  <nav class="links" aria-label="Contact and profile links">
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hananahmedeissa" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/hananeissa24" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
    <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yganehINaexGCC9BzUGeSFr8bOpPIWQE?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CV</a>
    <a class="primary" href="https://calendly.com/hananeissa24/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a call</a>
  </nav>

  <footer>Open to full-time roles and select freelance projects.</footer>
</main>

</body>
</html>
